{%- comment -%}
  Record one policy violation for a principal in the current abuse window (spec
  §12.4 abuse tracking). O(1): a single windowed counter (same mechanism as the rate
  limiter), NOT a ledger scan — the ledger remains the audit surface, this is just a
  cheap tripwire. Called at each violation exit in the pipeline (deny, invalid args,
  unknown tool, rate-limit).

  @param {string} principal_id
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  function object = 'modules/mcp/commands/limits/note_violation/build', principal_id: principal_id
  # Abuse tracking switched off (window <= 0): nothing to record.
  unless object.enabled
    return true
  endunless
  function object = 'modules/mcp/commands/limits/note_violation/check', object: object
  if object.valid
    function _ = 'modules/mcp/commands/limits/note_violation/execute', object: object
  endif
  return true
%}
